# value-line-string-midquote-comment

## Input

```
a value "x # y" tail

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..21
  ENTRY@0..21
    WORD_KEY@0..1
      WORD@0..1 "a"
    SPACE@1..2 " "
    LINE_STRING@2..10
      STRING@2..10 "value \"x"
    COMMENT@10..20 " # y\" tail"
    NEWLINE@20..21 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..1 "a",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@2..10 "value \"x",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

